    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaa <strong>Welcome to Death Park \u2013 a terrifying horror escape adventure with puzzles, nightmares, and a killer clown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a creepy abandoned amusement park where something has gone horribly wrong. An evil clown is hunting you\u2026 and you\u2019re completely alone. Explore the dark attractions, solve challenging puzzles, and uncover the mystery behind the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 Use stealth, strategy, and your wits to avoid deadly traps and survive. Death Park combines horror, exploration, and psychological tension with multiple endings depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf88 Scary horror experience with a unique setting \u2013 a haunted amusement park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Challenging puzzles and escape room elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd21 Terrifying evil clown with smart AI that hunts you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udded Multiple endings based on your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd26 Atmospheric visuals, immersive sound, and spine-chilling music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Intuitive first-person gameplay optimized for horror fans</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you escape the clown... or become part of his twisted show?\u00a0</p>",
